tps://www.panewslab.com/zh/articles/01a13709-9cb6-740c-bad9-ffb28b5030fa","publishedAt":"2026-10-13T20:51:00.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/05ff8f4aae1945ba9bb7300c7fa2755b1e21c0aba3ddfc70cd9bc11db3101fe6.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/79a5eb1742a839a34e8eba3975a15b3e2c76c9a88080b44a4f7703dd2968e315.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/05ff8f4aae1945ba9bb7300c7fa2755b1e21c0aba3ddfc70cd9bc11db3101fe6.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"Solana 上线 Alpenglow 升级，最终确认时间缩短至约 150 毫秒","summary":"Solana 自 2020 年以来最大规模的网络升级 Alpenglow 于周三正式上线，将验证者投票从链上移至链下并打包成证书，目标是把交易最终确认时间从约 6 秒缩短至约 150 毫秒，提速约 40 倍。作为对比，以太坊达到完全最终确认约需 13 分钟；同时验证者成本预计下降约 60%，目前验证者每天在投票费用上消耗约 2。","sourceName":"链捕手 ChainCatcher","sourceUrl":"https://www.chaincatcher.com/article/2297801","publishedAt":"2026-10-21T04:42:32.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"c1idos296oe2qe5b50mpcy7m6"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2f28b8d2924d2e1af02f9354c19807c5a62d2c1c5baead9a4b34ed24c2491fb7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp 96w","itemId":"yw0fttmnos3rmdcrbz0osj7ry","title":"Zcash联创提议终止社区资助自动拨款","summary":"Zcash联合创始人提议终止将新发行ZEC的8%自动分配给社区资助计划，称ZCG资产约为1.25亿美元，足够覆盖多年支出，继续分配会增加风险。","sourceName":"PANews","sourceUrl":"https://www.panewslab.com/zh/articles/01a17c08-0e14-73ce-900f-b04fef91cf08","publishedAt":"2026-10-27T06:24:25.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2f28b8d2924d2e1af02f9354c19807c5a62d2c1c5baead9a4b34ed24c2491fb7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.web