5390.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"美国9月CPI同比上涨3.7%，10月加息概率升至50%","summary":"美国9月CPI同比上涨3.7%，核心CPI同比上涨2.6%，均高于市场预期，环比涨幅分别为0.6%和0.3%。数据公布后，10月加息概率升至50%，美元走强、美债收益率上行，美股期货和现货黄金承压。能源与服务价格上涨被指为主要推动因素，市场将关注美联储10月27日至28日利率决议前的政策信号。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3783634","publishedAt":"2026-10-14T12:30:26.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"dgasb0ox39yxa2n8obzh0nl30"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/7e8ce065105487100c687f545f71e93c52c1c1932a32143bdd0fb0fffc4d7d49.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/0bbfd8b9f25f24983634e6e6abd82994e0befec127adb0ea475e2dab16084c08.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/7e8ce065105487100c687f545f71e93c52c1c1932a32143bdd0fb0fffc4d7d49.webp 96w","itemId":"cyyadg6wfavu8k9w933d40k9v","title":"中共中央、国务院印发《关于发展新质生产力的意见》","summary":"中共中央、国务院印发《关于发展新质生产力的意见》，围绕科技创新、产业融合、发展方式、体制机制和人才工作机制提出5方面19项重点举措。文件提出全面实施“人工智能+”行动、加大金融创新产品供给，并要求因地制宜推进，防止一哄而上、盲目投资和产业泡沫化。","sourceName":"东方财富","sourceUrl":"http://finance.eastmoney.com/news/1345,202610093891348451.html","publishedAt":"2026-10-09T10:01:08.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2f28b8d2924d2e1af02f9354c19807c5a62d2c1c5baead9a4b34ed24c2491fb7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"ESMA要求加密服务商停止提供非MiCA合规稳定币服务并在3个月内清退","summary":"ESMA要求欧盟加密资产服务提供商停止向欧盟客户提供涉及非MiCA合规稳定币的交易、兑换、托管、转账及投资建议等服务，并阻止客户买入或增持。存量敞口须在3个月内、最迟2027年1月8日前清理完毕，期间仅可提供卖出、兑换和提取等有限退出服务。","sourceName":"PANews","sourceUrl":"https://www.panewslab.com/zh/articles/01a11b05-15cf-7453-a5c5-29e037255063","publishedAt":"2026-10-08T10:17:00.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"emphoyx57gp8qvagk3omsqe49"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bea8e42ecaae675437f1d85767b96c288a979621c45bc55640df59c09fbb8bcb.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/7d7829b963afe835d4c9469a5d6120eb74c71d1e68c29cdeefc94446a6c51266.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bea8e42ecaae675437f1d85767b96c288a979621c45bc55640df59c09fbb8bcb.webp 96w","itemId":"y1ye2je39pcdhycishuznug5w","title":"英国财政大臣Healey捍卫预算案并警告未来财政决策挑战","summary":"英国财政大臣Healey捍卫新预算案并警告未来财政决策将面临挑战。其提到对银行的临时性税收上调，并建议英格兰银行在资本要求审查中考虑金融机构的国际竞争力。","sourceName":"Bloomberg Markets","sourceUrl":"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-10-29/healey-defends-uk-budget-warns-hard-decisions-ahead","publishedAt":"2026-10-29T06:00:36.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true}]},{"label":"股票市场","summary":"台积电Q4营收超预期6%，全年增速上调至44%；微软启动1900亿美元AI研发裁员计划，Reddit因谷歌AI搜索冲击单日暴跌30%。","items":[{"sourceIconUrl":null,"itemId":null,"title":"Anthropic提交IPO文件，启动上市倒计时","summary":"Anthropic提交了长达24万字的招股说明书，详细披露了公司的爆炸性增长、巨额亏损和严峻风险因素。","sourceName":"Financial Times","sourceUrl":"https://www.ft.com/content/f6ecfecd-d797-4d2c-b427-d333297949cb?syn-25a6b1a6=1","publishedAt":"2026-10-26T13:21:57.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"kbpivdt7kdbmyy794x0xsopb8"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":"cj9yowlh5favcgsyj8800r2vf","title":"台积电法说会：Q4营收指引超预期6%，全年增速上调至44%，考虑在美进一步扩产","summary":"台积电预计Q4营收523亿至543亿美元，中值533亿美元较市场预估503.5亿美元高约6%，并将全年营收增速预期从略高于40%上调至约44%。Q3净利润同比增69%，毛利率66.4%，公司维持2026年资本支出600亿至640亿美元不变。CEO魏哲家透露正与Terafab洽谈产能合作，并首次确认评估亚利桑那州以外扩产，得克萨斯州已在选址之列。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3783691","publishedAt":"2026-10-15T08:16:50.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/05ff8f4aae1945ba9bb7300c7fa2755b1e21c0aba3ddfc70cd9bc11db3101fe6.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/79a5eb1742a839a34e8eba3975a15b3e2c76c9a88080b44a4f7703dd2968e315.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/05ff8f4aae1945ba9bb7300c7fa2755b1e21c0aba3ddfc70cd9bc11db3101fe6.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"SK海力士三季度财报：营收与营业利润均超预期，推出百万亿韩元股东回报计划","summary":"SK海力士三季度营收104.62万亿韩元超预期9%，营业利润83.33万亿韩元同比增7倍创历史新高，但净利润39.53万亿韩元不及预期35%。公司宣布2026财年将返还100万亿韩元股东回报，含30万亿韩元现金分红及60万亿韩元股份回购注销。","sourceName":"链捕手 ChainCatcher","sourceUrl":"https://www.chaincatcher.com/article/2299439","publishedAt":"2026-10-28T00:49:53.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"t40u3dw7a8lt5wq1p9rc5do5a"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"Meta推出Muse Wonder系列模型，面向个人与专业智能体","summary":"Meta推出Muse Wonder和Muse Wonder Full两款模型，称其在编程、财务和法律问题处理等任务上可与ChatGPT和Claude竞争，并将用于升级个人AI智能体Muse。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3783469","publishedAt":"2026-10-12T16:58:37.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"n5sg0rx8om7koixt6phf8jq0p"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/c25a33f3f3500a495dc69cede8cf4fc350b907af79fc24007e68e0819db0747e.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/a192c125ac7c90e5e5369c2f6b25b235e5783c7c265d2b663f70de4fcda2fd35.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/c25a33f3f3500a495dc69cede8cf4fc350b907af79fc24007e68e0819db0747e.webp 96w","itemId":"gtqmuhx06cft2pdedat95m33p","title":"Reddit股价暴跌30%：谷歌AI搜索冲击流量与用户增长","summary":"Reddit股价单日暴跌30.44%至90.15美元，财报显示第三季度收入增长53%至8.95亿美元，但用户日活仅增12%至1.303亿，低于分析师预期。CEO Huffman指出谷歌AI搜索功能导致每周超百万次推荐流量下降，若趋势持续第四季度日活或下降10%-20%。Reddit正通过强制登录减少依赖谷歌流量，并已与Google、OpenAI达成数据合作，但可能进一步影响用户访问。","sourceName":"Decrypt","sourceUrl":"https://decrypt.co/382276/reddit-stock-plunges-30-googles-ai-search","publishedAt":"2026-10-30T19:31:02.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":null,"itemId":"w405nw49gqzpom9c8gepfvnjc","title":"微软推出大规模自愿离职计划，削减成本聚焦AI","summary":"微软启动大规模自愿离职计划，针对约7%的美国员工，计划花费约9亿美元。该计划基于“规则70”，即员工年龄加上在微软的工作年限达到70或以上即可申请。符合条件的员工可获得8至39周的现金补偿，医疗和股票期权继续有效。微软计划在AI相关开发上投入1900亿美元。","sourceName":"Crypto Briefing","sourceUrl":"https://cryptobriefing.com/microsoft-voluntary-buyout-program-rule-of-70/","publishedAt":"2026-10-26T15:34:39.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":"u5fvhnnr0qhwqhsra3gkrbwod","title":"波音财报：737产能目标推迟至2027年，自由现金流指引下修至2029年","summary":"波音2026年Q3净亏损1.16亿美元，737产能目标推迟至2027年，自由现金流指引下修至2029年。商业航空板块营收同比下滑3%至107.2亿美元，运营亏损6.97亿美元；防务业务营收增长15%至79.4亿美元，运营利润率提升至6.2%。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3784606","publishedAt":"2026-10-27T22:16:21.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true}]},{"label":"行业动态","summary":null,"items":[{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/05ff8f4aae1945ba9bb7300c7fa2755b1e21c0aba3ddfc70cd9bc11db3101fe6.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/79a5eb1742a839a34e8eba3975a15b3e2c76c9a88080b44a4f7703dd2968e315.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/05ff8f4aae1945ba9bb7300c7fa2755b1e21c0aba3ddfc70cd9bc11db3101fe6.webp 96w","itemId":"n0lpdg7e8c5ns873irw0wd2ts","title":"Meta宣布大规模增发融资计划，总额达950亿美元","summary":"Meta宣布启动约350亿美元的普通股和强制可转换优先股公开发行，并计划未来推出最高约600亿美元的场内股票发行计划，潜在融资规模合计达950亿美元。","sourceName":"链捕手 ChainCatcher","sourceUrl":"https://www.chaincatcher.com/article/2299004","publishedAt":"2026-10-26T12:37:04.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2f28b8d2924d2e1af02f9354c19807c5a62d2c1c5baead9a4b34ed24c2491fb7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp 96w","itemId":"nfm5n85o9ntu0ha9tygi8zkpn","title":"Anthropic IPO草案：上半年营收163亿美元，净亏损807亿美元","summary":"Anthropic 提交的 S-1 注册声明草案显示，其 2026 年上半年营收 163 亿美元，去年同期为 11 亿美元；上半年净亏损 807 亿美元，去年同期亏损 130 亿美元，亏损主要来自融资相关的非现金会计费用。","sourceName":"PANews","sourceUrl":"https://www.panewslab.com/zh/articles/01a15ae4-7632-7432-8dee-fead3e2b8e2f","publishedAt":"2026-10-20T19:58:04.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true}]},{"label":"观点与教程","summary":null,"items":[{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2f28b8d2924d2e1af02f9354c19807c5a62d2c1c5baead9a4b34ed24c2491fb7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"NFL向美国最高法院提交意见，主张体育预测合约属于赌博而非互换","summary":"NFL于10月8日向美国最高法院提交法庭之友意见书，支持新泽西州监管机构诉Kalshi一案，主张体育预测合约属于赌博而非互换，不应由CFTC专属管辖，并请求法院受理。NFL称，本赛季首个周日预测市场的33亿美元交易额中，近20亿美元与NFL赛事相关；Kalshi则称CFTC监管更为统一。","sourceName":"PANews","sourceUrl":"https://www.panewslab.com/zh/articles/01a11ca4-fddd-703b-8174-c762220f1195","publishedAt":"2026-10-08T17:51:00.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"t1x4yrfnlwdyjdtp1s39k3huz"}]}],"flashes":[],"cover":null,"metrics":{"totalStories":30,"selectedCount":3520,"reportsCovered":24},"readingMinutes":10,"prev":null,"next":null}